### Python and build-time dependencies

The applications also use separately distributed third-party packages, depending on the application and installation/build configuration. These include:

- PySide6 / Qt
- NumPy
- Pillow
- texture2ddecoder
- zstandard
- wgpu-py
- PyInstaller (build-time)

These packages are not granted or relicensed under the XXAMI DumpAna terms. Each remains subject to its own license, notices, and distribution requirements. Consult the corresponding upstream project and package distribution for the license version applicable to the version you install or bundle.

